[{"id":162379417,"discussion_id":"9e5f4ca3248c23d3d0d64bc92138d6d3186f77db","body":"Thanks for your pull-request.\nThe full list of commands accepted by me can be found at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/robot/robot%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md#-%E5%A6%82%E9%9C%80%E4%BA%86%E8%A7%A3%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E7%9A%84%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E5%8F%AF%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83%E4%B8%8B%E6%96%B9%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E8%A1%A8%E6%A0%BC)。\nYou can get sig-info at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/community/blob/master/CANN/sigs/ops-nn/sig-info.yaml)\n\n\n---\n\n## PR Approval Progress\n\n✅ **Congratulations! All modules have met the lgtm and approve requirements.**\n\n### Module Approval Details\n\n| module | lgtm status | approve status |\n|------|-----------|--------------|\n| index | ✅ [*wangyongguang*](https://gitcode.com/wangyongguang), [*zhou-qilong*](https://gitcode.com/zhou-qilong) (2/2) | ✅ [*wangyongguang*](https://gitcode.com/wangyongguang), [*zhou-qilong*](https://gitcode.com/zhou-qilong) (2/1) |\n\n> \uD83D\uDCA1 Tip:\n> - **Committer** can comment `/approve` or `/lgtm`\n> - Commenting `/approve` implies both code review (lgtm) and intent to merge (approve)\n","created_at":"2026-02-05T20:38:12+08:00","updated_at":"2026-02-07T15:11:07+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":162379429,"discussion_id":"c3604f5a37cc15eaac52af6e55b25975f068ddce","body":"### CLA Signature Pass  \n hhuwenao, thanks for your pull request. All authors of the commits have signed the CLA. :+1: ","created_at":"2026-02-05T20:38:16+08:00","updated_at":"2026-02-05T20:38:16+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":162379430,"discussion_id":"eb28bfd88528c31a9c56009348e9fb66b9778b48","body":":large_blue_circle: source code change are detected, tasks labels is removed in this pull request!","created_at":"2026-02-05T20:38:16+08:00","updated_at":"2026-02-05T20:38:16+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":162379488,"discussion_id":"273b5bb98517e6d44772b5c9fc676e1ef53c1f56","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n本次PR旨在解决ScatterAdd算子在特定硬件架构（如arch35）下，当`updates`为非标量且操作为`SUB`时，因数据在内存传输引擎（MTE）、向量单元（V）和存储单元（S）之间流动时序不当而可能引发的竞态条件与数据一致性问题。通过添加硬件事件同步机制，确保计算路径的正确性。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n在`ScatterAddSIMDSupportAtomicAdd`内核函数的非标量数据处理分支中，新增两处硬件事件同步点。首先，在从全局内存拷贝数据到本地缓冲区前，使用`MTE3_MTE2`事件确保前序MTE操作完成。其次，在执行减法操作前，使用`MTE2_V`事件确保数据已从MTE2传输至向量单元V。这些同步通过`SetFlag`和`WaitFlag`原语实现，是AscendC编程模型中保障流水线正确性的标准做法。","created_at":"2026-02-05T20:38:36+08:00","updated_at":"2026-02-05T20:38:36+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":162516724,"discussion_id":"6fb9c98f55630c0645751185f2f2046696b7c7b6","body":"compile","created_at":"2026-02-07T09:47:27+08:00","updated_at":"2026-02-07T09:47:27+08:00","user":{"id":"68bf83e94dcd85262390d3d2","login":"hhuwenao","object_id":"68bf83e94dcd85262390d3d2","name":"hhu